          "Id": "MECH_ARTIPOCI_S101.1",
          "Title": "Section 101.1:",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               In addition to the zoning regulations authorized by the general laws of the State\n               and pursuant to the procedures set forth therein, the Council by ordinance may adopt\n               and enforce exterior design and landscaping guidelines for buildings, structures,\n               and open spaces. (Amd. Charter Election 3-25-86)\n               </p></div>",
