          "TitleHtml": "<div class=\"chunk-title\">Section 101.2: - RESTRICTION ON USE OF EMINENT DOMAIN</div>",
          "ShouldShowMiniToc": false,
          "Id": "MECH_ARTIPOCI_S101.2REUSEMDO",
          "Title": "Section 101.2: - RESTRICTION ON USE OF EMINENT DOMAIN",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               Private property shall not be taken for any use, except as specifically provided for\n               in the Arizona Constitution. The City shall not take any property through eminent\n               domain without a public hearing and public vote of the City Council. In no event may\n               any private real property acquired by the City through eminent domain be dedicated,\n               sold, leased or otherwise transferred to a private person, partnership, corporation\n               or any other entity for a period of ten (10) years following the acquisition of the\n               property by the City. (Amd. Charter Election 3-9-04/IN02-1)\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
